          <td><span class="postbody"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Freeport</span>
<br />

<br />

<br />
<ul>Dyric Pire - East Freeport - Hallard's Bolt and Arrow (General Store on map) -
<br />
 All heavy and medium armor wearers (except Defiler).
<br />

<br />
Vassi Darkscale - North Freeport - 2nd floor Jade Tiger's Den (Inn on map) - 
<br />
 All light armor wearers plus Defiler. 
<br />

<br />
Kirsteh the Witch - East Freeport - The Freeport Observer (Scribe on map) - 
<br />
 All very light armor wearers. 
<br />

<br />
</ul>
<br />

<br />
<span style="text-decoration: underline">Qeynos</span>
<br />

<br />

<br />
<ul>Ian Cathlan - Qeynos Harbor - By the clock -
<br />
 All heavy and medium armor wearers (except Mystic). 
<br />

<br />
Selwyn Oakheart - South Qeynos - Under tree by North Qeynos gate -
<br />
 All light armor wearers plus Mystic. 
<br />

<br />
Gildas Cedartree - The Elddar Grove - Zen garden near dojo -
<br />
 All very light armor wearers.</ul><br />_________________<br />Saving Carstman since <a href="http://www.dalharen.com/dfimb/images/screenshots/ssdeath009.jpg" target="_blank" class="postlink">2002</a></span><span class="gensmall"><i><br /><br />Last edited by Shanawa on Tue Nov 30, 2004 9:11 am; edited 2 times in total</i></span></td>
