<span style="text-decoration: underline">Dyric Pire</span>
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Part 1</span>
<br />

<br />
This quest has 2 steps:
<br />
Kill 18 Fallen Guardians
<br />
Kill Anders Blackhammer
<br />

<br />
The Fallen Guardians roam around the Ruins of Val'Marr, usually they can be found alone, they can also be found grouped with crusaders and disciples in the buildings just south of the ruins. If you're alone, stick to the north edge of the ruins where several will spawn alone, if grouped, you can clear all the buildings and finish much faster. This stage should take one to three hours depending on your level of devotion and how contested the spawns are. The solo guardians will all be green and gray at this level.
<br />

<br />
Anders Blackhammer spawns in the Crossroads near Merchant Valary. At 20 and 21 he cons White with 2 up arrows (white^^). Even with the double arrows, he's an undercon. I was barely able to duo him at 21 with a 21 Fury, usually we can take white^^ very easily. His max normal melee hit appears to be around 150, but his combat abilities can hit for up to 300.
<br />

<br />
