          <td><span class="postbody"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Kirsteh the Witch </span>
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Part 1</span>
<br />

<br />
Kill 18 Fallen Disciples.
<br />
Kill Lady Anyanka Polevshi.
<br />

<br />
Fallen Disciples spawn around ruins north of Hidden Canyon tower.
<br />
Lady Anyanka Polevshi roams around the river bank with the rest of the Fallen.
<br />

<br />
<img src="http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/128232555137.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/128232555137.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Part 2</span>
<br />

<br />
Fallen Gate
<br />

<br />
Kill 8 Teir'Dal War Witches (near pool area) 
<br />
Kill 12 Mindless Corpses (throughout dungeon) 
<br />
Kill 2 Suspended Watchers (on way towards Gong of Uglan) 
<br />

<br />
<img src="http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/160963441799.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/160963441799.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Part 3</span>
<br />

<br />
Fallen Gate
<br />

<br />
Kill 6 Teir'Dal War Mages 
<br />
Kill 12 Constructs of Malice 
<br />
Kill 8 Giant Wretches
<br />

<br />
<img src="http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/161067847779.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/161067847779.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Part 4</span>
<br />

<br />
Edgewater Drains 
<br />

<br />
- 20 Contaminated Rats 
<br />
- 12 Murkwater Henchnman 
<br />
- 24 Drudge Mucus Slugs
<br />

<br />
<img src="http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/160955916294.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/160955916294.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Part 5</span>
<br />

<br />
Nektulos Forest
<br />

<br />
- 18 Motley Kodiak Claws (near Commonlands) 
<br />
- 10 Perfect Mandibles from Forest Leapers (on beach) 
<br />
- 18 Hard Shells from Nerius Crabs (on beach) 
<br />
- 1 Eye of a Nerius Pirate Captain (on beach) 
<br />

<br />
You can solo the crabs and the kodiaks. You will need a group for the Captain and the Forest Leapers.
<br />

<br />
<img src="http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/168969796170.jpg" border="0" onclick="if(this.width == 550) { window.open('http://eq2images.station.sony.com/itemicons/168969796170.jpg', '_blank' ,'scrollbars=1,toolbar=no,resizable=1,menubar=no,directories=no,status=yes'); return false; }" alt="" style="cursor: hand" />
<br />

<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold">Part 6 -Final</span>
<br />

<br />
Nektulos Forest
<br />

<br />
- 24 Wings from Asilian Fairies 
<br />
- 12 Essences from Ashland Wisps 
<br />
- 10 Tears from Mist Grinnins 
<br />

<br />
In addition to this you must find the Buried Research Notes at Fallen Gate. To do this you must head to the Pool of Percelia in Fallen Gate. This is the room with the pool and the island, just past the market. The group needs to run on to the middle island, which will spawn a boss and a couple of guards. Kill them and the quest will trigger to advance.
<br />

<br />
